<Base title="About"><article><span class="kicker">About me</span><div class="article-body"><p>I'm Lisandro. For over 25 years I've worked across the Microsoft stack, and these days most of my time goes into Copilot Studio and Microsoft Foundry.</p><p>This blog is where I share that journey. Technical posts on building with Copilot and Foundry, and non-technical posts on everything else that comes with this kind of work: the mistakes, the half-answers, the stuff that only makes sense after you've broken it once.</p><p>I love this technology. I love sharing it even more. None of us have this fully figured out, so let's work through it together.</p></div></article></Base>
